\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The Heterogeneous-Oracle World-Probing (HOWP) pipeline for annotation-free NL-to-FOL candidate selection. Given an NL sentence, the generator produces $k{=}5$ FOL candidates. For each candidate, $m{=}8$ diagnostic worlds are generated by the oracle LLM (from a different model family), evaluated deterministically by the symbolic model checker, and scored by cross-world agreement with oracle truth judgments. The highest-scoring candidate is passed to Z3 for downstream inference.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{1}{2}{The Heterogeneous-Oracle World-Probing (HOWP) pipeline for annotation-free NL-to-FOL candidate selection. Given an NL sentence, the generator produces $k{=}5$ FOL candidates. For each candidate, $m{=}8$ diagnostic worlds are generated by the oracle LLM (from a different model family), evaluated deterministically by the symbolic model checker, and scored by cross-world agreement with oracle truth judgments. The highest-scoring candidate is passed to Z3 for downstream inference}{figure.1}{}}
